OL,3,GNEWSAMan left with life-threatening
OL,4,Ainjuries after off-road bike and car
OL,5,Acrash
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 19-year-old man has been taken to
OL,8,Fhospital after a crash between a car
OL,9,Fand an off-road bike in Paisley.
OL,11,FThe crash, which involved an orange
OL,12,Foff-road bike and a grey Vauxhall
OL,13,FCorsa, happened at about 21:45 on
OL,14,FSaturday night at the junction between
OL,15,FFoxbar Road and Gleniffer Road.
OL,17,FThe man was taken to the Queen
OL,18,FElizabeth University Hospital with
OL,19,Flife-threatening injuries. His
OL,20,Fcondition has been described as
OL,21,Fserious. The 22-year-old female driver
OL,22,Fwas also taken to hospital.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
